  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "dclm-baseline-1.0",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDCLM-baseline\n\t\n\nDCLM-baseline is a 4T token / 3B document pretraining dataset that achieves strong performance on language model benchmarks.\nBelow are comparisions of model trained on DCLM-baseline with other models in the 7B regime.\n\n\t\n\t\t\nModel\nParams\nTokens\nOpen dataset?\nCORE\nMMLU\nEXTENDED\n\n\n\t\t\nOpen weights, closed datasets\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLlama2\n7B\n2T\n\u2717\n49.2\n45.8\n34.1\n\n\nDeepSeek\n7B\n2T\n\u2717\n50.7\n48.5\n35.3\n\n\nMistral-0.3\n7B\n?\n\u2717\n57.0\n62.7\n45.1\n\n\nQWEN-2\n7B\n?\n\u2717\n57.5\n71.9\n50.5\n\n\nLlama3\n8B\n15T\n\u2717\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/mlfoundations/dclm-baseline-1.0.",
  "alternateName": [
    "mlfoundations/dclm-baseline-1.0"
  ],
